        rdfs:comment                   "Initialied \"IF\". Gift basket with glass beads on white silk floor and wire frame; raised work. Floor has scene with king under canopy at center with man to left and woman to right. Frame has various fruits, vegetables and flowers, all worked in beads; under the handles appear a lion, a unicorn, a lady, and a man. Good condition, silks soiled."@en ;
